Data and code here go with the accepted manuscript "Seasonal temperature 
sequences drive divergent developmental trajectories in a species with an 
extended breeding season" by Hannah Yin and Volker H.W. Rudolf.

Dataset access and citation information on Harvard Dataverse: 
https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/CO3VBM

Manuscript DOI: 10.1002/oik.12635

Note: opening .csv files in Excel may change date formats from YYYY-MM-DD to 
m/d/YYYY. Either adjust code accordingly where indicated in code files, or open
.csv files in another program or a raw text file editor if deciding to view!


RAW DATASETS
Raw data all located in datasets/raw folder

1. start_date_conditions.csv

2. Seasonal air temperature transition times
- springfall_temperature_daily_highlow.csv (not input for code, for reference)
- summer_temperature_daily_highlow.csv (not input for code, for reference)
- winter_temperature_weekly_highlow.csv

3. sequence_schedules.csv

4. Field data
- rana_clamitans_nightlycalls.csv
- leaves.csv
- water_temperatures/field/6mo_5min_p1_temperature_HOBO.csv
- water_temperatures/field/6mo_5min_p4_temperature_HOBO.csv
- seasonal_field_photoperiod/ponds5-8_darkness_2001.txt
- seasonal_field_photoperiod/ponds5-8_daylight_2001.txt
- seasonal_field_air_temperature.csv

5. Chamber water temperatures, including nine .csv files
- water_temperatures/chamber/*
in format [three-digit room number and letter] [season] temps [YYYY-MM-DD] 
through [YYYY-MM-DD].csv

6. Larvae
- tadpoles_midcensus.csv
- tadpoles_growth.csv
- tadpoles_behavior/video_info.csv
- tadpoles_behavior/startstop_times.csv

7. metamorphosis.csv


SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS
Tested with:

1. Python version 3.8
Published packages (outside standard library): jupyterlab (v3.4.5), 
pandas (v2.0.3), numpy (v1.24.3), matplotlib (v3.6.0)

2. R version 4.2.0
Published packages: dplyr (v1.1.4), ggplot2 (v3.5.1), Hmisc (v5.1-2), 
emmeans (v1.10.3), fitdistrplus (v1.1-11), bbmle (v1.0.25), lme4 (v1.1-34), 
performance (v0.15.3), glmmTMB (v1.1.10), survival (v3.6-4), tramME (v1.0.7), 
car (v3.1-3), purrr (v1.0.2), vegan (v2.6-4), reshape2 (v1.4.4), brunnermunzel 
(v2.0), cowplot (v1.1.1)


WORKFLOW WITH CODE
Referring to input and output data in the datasets folder:

sequence_schedules.R plots Figure 1 and prepares .csv files for analysis in 
larvae_metamorphosis.R.
Input data:
- processed/sequence_temperature_to_plot.csv
- processed/sequence_photoperiod_to_plot.csv
Output data:
- processed/temperature_sequence_seasonal_means.csv

sequence_schedules.ipynb prepares .csv files to plot Figure 1 in 
sequence_schedules.R.
Input data:
- raw/winter_temperature_weekly_highlow.csv
Output:
- processed/sequence_temperature_to_plot.csv
- processed/sequence_photoperiod_to_plot.csv

larvae_metamorphosis.R provides code for most data analysis and figures, 
including all tables and figures in the main manuscript except for Figure 1.
Input data: 
- raw/tadpoles_midcensus.csv
- raw/tadpoles_growth.csv
- processed/tadpoles_behavior.csv
- raw/metamorphosis.csv
- raw/start_date_conditions.csv
- processed/temperature_sequence_seasonal_means.csv
- raw/sequence_schedules.csv
- processed/sequence_temperature_to_plot.csv
- processed/sequence_photoperiod_to_plot.csv

video_coding_preprocess.ipynb processes raw data collected from 
behavioral trials.
Input data:
- raw/tadpoles_behavior/video_info.csv
- raw/tadpoles_behavior/startstop_times.csv
Output data:
- processed/tadpoles_behavior.csv

field_to_lab.R plots Figures S1-S2 and Figure S5.
Input data: 
- raw/rana_clamitans_nightlycalls.csv
- raw/leaves.csv
- processed/chamber_water_temperature_HOBO.csv
- processed/pond_water_temperature_p1_HOBO.csv
- processed/pond_water_temperature_p4_HOBO.csv

field_to_lab.ipynb plots Figures S3-S4 while preparing .csv files
to plot in field_to_lab.R.
Input data: 
- raw/seasonal_field_photoperiod/ponds5-8_daylight_2001.txt
- raw/seasonal_field_photoperiod/ponds5-8_darkness_2001.txt
- raw/seasonal_field_air_temperature.csv
- raw/water_temperatures/chamber/*
- raw/water_temperatures/field/*
Output data: 
- processed/pond_water_temperature_p1_HOBO.csv
- processed/pond_water_temperature_p4_HOBO.csv
- processed/chamber_water_temperature_HOBO.csv
